## ⚠️ Limitations

- Generated replies may contain inaccuracies and should be reviewed before sending.
- The application requires a valid Groq API key and access to a supported model.
- Email content is sent to the configured model provider for processing.
- The current version does not automatically read or send emails through Gmail or Outlook.

